{"source":"user-event","type":"click","text":"A\n    \n      Phase-Gated (like Foundational Brief)\n      Ingestion → Auto-Summary → Section-by-section conversation → Pressure test → Output\n      After ingestion, the agent presents its synthesis of the brand strategy section. You approve or revise it. Then it moves to the next section (SEO, Paid, Social, etc.), each with its own approval gate. Pressure test runs at the end. Produces .docx incrementally.\n      Predictable. Every section gets explicit approval. But rigid — hard to riff across sections or change direction mid-stream.","choice":"a","id":null,"timestamp":1775077562201}
{"source":"user-event","type":"click","text":"B\n    \n      Structured Top, Freeform Bottom (Recommended)\n      Ingestion → Auto-Summary → Brand Strategy (guided) → Channel Strategies (conversational) → Pressure test → Output\n      Brand Strategy (mission, value prop, audiences, messaging) follows a structured flow with approval. Then channel strategies open up — you riff freely, the agent organizes your thinking into the right sections. Scope flags appear inline as you go. Pressure test at the end collects everything. Document generated after pressure test passes.\n      Matches how you described working — structured where it's repeatable, conversational where it's creative. Agent drives the brand section, you drive the channel sections.","choice":"b","id":null,"timestamp":1775077629358}
